        <details xmi:id="_Iu9aU5UIEeqqGZh46IEtXQ" key="gmm-documentation" value="&lt;p&gt;This class model represents the entities and relations of an online shopping cart system. It&amp;#39;s one of the possible implementations for such a system. Fork it to generate Java and Spring (Roo and Data Rest) code to get a usable implementation.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;"/>
